  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_66324119-8baf-4354-9a58-844c56660631.png\"><br><br></strong></span><strong>请注意，这是<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">测试版</span></span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">整合包</span></span>的早期版本，您可能会遇到一些漏洞。<br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/bcCqRpc4mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_61b19ee6-9bb9-4048-a1a9-259d3066028f.png\" width=\"436\" height=\"101\"></a><br></strong><br><br><strong>禁用</strong>CurseForge中的<em>\"跳过Mojang启动器\"</em>选项。<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><br>（可能导致问题）<br><br></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>内存分配：<br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">- <strong>推荐：8GB</strong> -</span></strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_d057c668-4a7f-41d4-b475-ef00cbc2a9d7.png\"><br><br></span></h4><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Ascendra</strong>是一款以<strong>探索、魔法与科技</strong>为核心的<strong>整合包</strong>。<br>踏入一个充满<strong>全新维度、强力Boss以及大量新建筑结构</strong>的世界。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Ascendra拥有<strong>独特的进阶线路</strong>，持续推动你前进。<br>面对<strong>史诗级全新Boss</strong>，掌握魔法，建造科技，并克服<strong>艰巨挑战</strong>。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Ascendra同样包含<strong>惬意放松的玩法</strong>，让你能放慢节奏，<strong>建造</strong>、<strong>农耕</strong>，并按自己的步调<strong>享受世界</strong>。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">凭借<strong>440多个模组</strong>、<strong>沉浸式任务</strong>和<strong>全面重制的世界生成</strong>，<strong>Ascendra</strong>带来<strong>长期游玩的体验</strong>。</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>想和朋友一起玩Ascendra？<br><br></strong>我们推荐使用<strong>Wabbanode</strong>获得<strong>可靠稳定</strong>的服务器托管。<strong><br></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fmagicsascension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_a9d16eb2-7307-4d60-a690-174c0321133c.png\" width=\"608\" height=\"122\"></a><br><br>同时<strong>欢迎</strong>加入我们的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bcCqRpc4mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a>以<strong>获取最新动态</strong>，或与<strong>社区互动</strong>。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_05c58146-2be5-4ca9-b8a7-65c816b1d486.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_7d68dfd9-981d-4d2e-8b38-e1c36c5a9f86.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_45061a24-11dd-476e-ad4c-3e14247620a4.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_5360af35-7341-4d93-8b2b-c35843914197.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_1f937e70-916a-4831-8e77-c1673045cecf.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_4ebfdec4-94e5-4bc1-97d4-e082b5978b71.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_a56357e1-e176-4032-9b3b-8191dd272ab6.png\"><br><br>🌍 </strong></span><strong>强化世界</strong>生成，拥有<strong>大量新生物群系</strong>等待探索！<span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong><br><br></strong></span>⚔ <strong>强化战斗</strong>系统，搭载<strong>Better Combat</strong><br><br>🪄 <strong>学习魔法</strong>、<strong>施放法术</strong>、<strong>变得强大</strong>！<br><br>🏰 超过<strong>500个建筑结构</strong>等你探索！<br><br>🧑‍🌾 使用<strong>农夫乐事</strong>烹饪美食<br><br>🛠 运用科技模组实现自动化！<br><br>💻<strong> 卓越性能</strong>，即使搭载400多个模组也流畅运行</p>",
